ent-Pen = 筆 | pen
    .desc = 一支深色墨水筆。 | A dark ink pen.
ent-PenEmbeddable = { ent-Pen }
    .desc = { ent-Pen.desc }
ent-LuxuryPen = 名牌鋼筆 | luxury pen
    .desc = 一支精緻且昂貴的鋼筆，唯有當你具備處理大量文書工作的資格時，才配擁有它。 | A fancy and expensive pen that you only deserve to own if you're qualified to handle vast amounts of paperwork.
ent-BaseAdvancedPen = { ent-PenEmbeddable }
    .desc = { ent-PenEmbeddable.desc }
ent-CyberPen = Cybersun 鋼筆 | Cybersun pen
    .desc = 這支來自 Cybersun 法務部門的高科技鋼筆，能透過其鑽石筆尖以難以置信的角度折射「硬光」來書寫。其威力之強，甚至能在必要時重寫已加蓋官方印章的文件。 | A high-tech pen straight from Cybersun's legal department, capable of refracting hard-light at impossible angles through its diamond tip in order to write. So powerful, it's even able to rewrite officially stamped documents should the need arise.
ent-PenCentcom = 中央司令部 鋼筆 | CentComm pen
    .desc = 為了跟上「賽博太陽」官僚體系的「勢力」，NT 依照其企業風格，製作了一支仿製的賽博筆。 | In an attempt to keep up with the "power" of the cybersun bureaucracy, NT made a replica of cyber pen, in their corporate style.
ent-PenCap = 船長鋼筆 | captain's fountain pen
    .desc = 一支專為站長準備的豪華鋼筆。 | A luxurious fountain pen for the captain of the station.
ent-PenHop = HoP 的鋼筆 | HoP's fountain pen
    .desc = 一支專為該站站長準備的豪華鋼筆。 | A luxurious fountain pen for the HoP of the station.
ent-PenWiz = 巫師的魔法筆 | wizard's magical pen
    .desc = 一支奢華的鋼筆。似乎配有一塊神奇的水晶橡皮擦。 | A luxurious fountain pen. Seems to have a magical crystal eraser.
